WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
The first standing light punch catches Ryu as Counter Hit.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.850
The light target cancels into Drive Rush and standing medium kick.

3
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.450
The second Rush cancel spends the remaining Drive and enters Burnout.

4
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.900
Heavy Dimachaerus and its forward-punch follow-up launch Ryu.

5
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.450
Heavy Gladius confirms into Level 3.

6
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.250
Level 3 leaves Ryu knocked down.
